      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;20231021-lab-visit-kurita-lab&#34;&gt;20231021 Lab Visit: Kurita Lab&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I visited the &lt;a href=&#34;https://soft.fpark.tmu.ac.jp/&#34;&gt;Kurita Lab&lt;/a&gt; with &lt;a href=&#34;https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.22369&#34;&gt;Mr. Shimamoto&lt;/a&gt; and many others. During a break at &lt;a href=&#34;https://soft.fpark.tmu.ac.jp/ks/ks2023.html&#34;&gt;Kanto Soft Matter&lt;/a&gt;, a conversation with Mr. Shimamoto and a member of the Kurita Lab led to an invitation to tour the lab. As we gathered more people interested in joining, the group became unexpectedly large.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
